Rule 5 (weight must match input dtype and be broadcastable to input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_3) = dtype_(v_1) ∧ (ndim(v_3) = 0 ∨ (ndim(v_3) = ndim(v_1) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_3, i) = shape(v_1, i)))
